{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音逸。\n淫，樂過也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《切韻》：上尺氏反，上聲；奢也。下文彼反；亦奢侈\n也"}
